=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/J0GZNLFasD4icT0p7Hm1mW2gZlnxzegW4YvA3blkR3sqdakIjF6xgQlmWrvMRprzjd9T5nHhORJ0DeuCRric7RqQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/J0GZNLFasD4icT0p7Hm1mW2gZlnxzegW4VqmQKdjazhLToMbV2pDFcGqtl4wVacTBUhCJQAVyAQPUr9CLr9hfSA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/J0GZNLFasD4icT0p7Hm1mW2gZlnxzegW4p4vWHnqAoaqjyCOPfbYTerJlmFwKqoicJEmwicsUBsgGMIickFSjKG6Xw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/J0GZNLFasD4icT0p7Hm1mW2gZlnxzegW4Lamic3ficFV6cgDX7qybIEXzg4T5vwTmiasm9meyuvgl2CUVHL2hmNMtw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/J0GZNLFasD4icT0p7Hm1mW2gZlnxzegW4Gev1icu4VDzxnwOMmR3oHra36fuw2xXKpeg6ia7oaXb8a7Wy53kzxPpQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/J0GZNLFasD4icT0p7Hm1mW2gZlnxzegW4TLe7LJiafvibYMdc0e4ibrOGJNYZSiblEyKV4tu8FRDibrA9yIWQpEFSbiaw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/J0GZNLFasD4icT0p7Hm1mW2gZlnxzegW4mYjhY5j48OgKVic0hK3A0GkHDibb3o9KzBp6RiaQXvSribyuAPKglniahwg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/J0GZNLFasD4icT0p7Hm1mW2gZlnxzegW4l7fQW3rjUKdEd4qJjiaMl8iczmV6gR3w1hlmjONjLW3LXa46jzlFzs3g/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section></section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>城市交通学院简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>城市交通学院交通运输工程学科始于1979年，分别于1981和1996年获得全国首批交通运输规划与管理学科硕士和博士学位授予权，1994年获批北京市重点学科，2007年道路与轨道工程获批北京市重点建设学科。2022年获批“交通强国”建设试点单位。学院围绕交通规划与多模式综合优化、交通信息与协同管控、低碳智慧交通基础设施建养理论与方法、轨道智能运行与运营技术、交通行为机理与系统安全韧性等方向，形成了解决以北京为代表的城市智能、高效、安全、节能等交通问题的鲜明特色。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/J0GZNLFasD4icT0p7Hm1mW2gZlnxzegW422qo26ibib5BTpG3YPqrcFlemHOia0evYH2WD8YtGmJU72ibXEq0tEDIZw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>师资队伍</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>学院坚持以城市交通为学科发展基石，面向交通领域重大需求开展综合交通、智慧交通、设施运维等方向的特色研究；坚守立德树人根本任务，扎实推进人才培养工作，拥有一批包含国家及省部级高层次人才、兼职中国工程院院士在内的高水平一流师资队伍。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/J0GZNLFasD4icT0p7Hm1mW2gZlnxzegW422qo26ibib5BTpG3YPqrcFlemHOia0evYH2WD8YtGmJU72ibXEq0tEDIZw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>人才培养</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>学院秉持政产学研用相结合办学理念，依托各类协同创新平台支撑高水平人才培养。现有省部共建国家重点实验室培育基地、多个北京市重点实验室与交通运输部行业重点实验室、协同创新平台及共建研发中心，是国家新型智库-交通运输新型智库联盟理事单位。学院建有国内高校唯一接入省级城市交通运行数据的综合交通大数据平台。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/J0GZNLFasD4icT0p7Hm1mW2gZlnxzegW422qo26ibib5BTpG3YPqrcFlemHOia0evYH2WD8YtGmJU72ibXEq0tEDIZw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>就业情况</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>学生主要就业于高等教育、科研设计、国有企业和党政机关等单位。学位点定期组织相关讲座和毕业生就业培训会，帮助毕业生适应就业形势、熟悉就业政策、增强权益保障意识。通过毕业生质量问卷调查和与用人单位的广泛接触，了解到用人单位对学校毕业生的社会评价良好，认为北京工业大学交通运输工程学科毕业生的综合素质较高。学校很多毕业生工作几年以后已经走上了重要岗位，进入管理层或成为技术研发部门的骨干力量。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/J0GZNLFasD4icT0p7Hm1mW2gZlnxzegW422qo26ibib5BTpG3YPqrcFlemHOia0evYH2WD8YtGmJU72ibXEq0tEDIZw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>拟接收推免研究生学科专业</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Z6uh0fb0vBU0KicrOjLNFIhazxx5pJtNJXVGtszgof2kCDWdLZv7kXgJ8qiaWC4FfheSWArXTHQEEKLDofBlRdAEDvSxibDia0Ww6BmI16P2iaw8/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/J0GZNLFasD4icT0p7Hm1mW2gZlnxzegW422qo26ibib5BTpG3YPqrcFlemHOia0evYH2WD8YtGmJU72ibXEq0tEDIZw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>06</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>推免研究生报名方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>（一）预报名阶段（即日起至9月20日）即日起至9月20日，推免生可登录北京工业大学研究生招生网（http://yanzhao.bjut.edu.cn/），点击“网上报名”—“推免生报名”，进入“北京工业大学推免预报名系统”进行预报名。在教育部推免服务系统开通后，请推免生（含已预报名推免生）务必登录教育部推免服务系统进行正式报名。届时学院将根据申请人的复试综合成绩，在教育部“推免服务系统”向通过复试且符合要求的推免生依次发送“待录取”通知，择优录取。推免生须登录“推免服务系统”，并按照要求在学院规定的时间内点击确认“待录取”后，才能获得推免拟录取资格，完成最终拟录取。错过预报名时间的推免生如仍有意愿报考我院，可在正式报名阶段直接在教育部推免服务系统中报名。</span></p><p><span>（二）正式报名阶段（9月21日9:00-10月20日）9月21日9:00教育部推免服务系统开通后，请登录中国研究生招生信息网（http://yz.chsi.com.cn/）“全国推荐优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生信息公开暨管理服务系统”，完成注册并填报学生信息，并进行正式报名。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/J0GZNLFasD4icT0p7Hm1mW2gZlnxzegW422qo26ibib5BTpG3YPqrcFlemHOia0evYH2WD8YtGmJU72ibXEq0tEDIZw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>07</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>复试方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>复试形式：</span></strong></span><span>复试以“远程面试”的形式进行，城市交通学院选用的远程复试系统是腾讯会议。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>复试时间：</span></span></strong><span>预报名阶段和正式报名阶段均可组织复试，复试时间及其他要求将通过报名系统或邮件形式另通知，请各位推免生务必保持联系方式畅通。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>复试内容及要求：</span></span></strong><span>复试考核内容主要包括外语听说能力测试、专业能力考核、综合面试三个部分。复试相关要求详见我校研招网发布的北京工业大学2027年接收推荐免试研究生工作办法。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/J0GZNLFasD4icT0p7Hm1mW2gZlnxzegW422qo26ibib5BTpG3YPqrcFlemHOia0evYH2WD8YtGmJU72ibXEq0tEDIZw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>08</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>010-67391685</span></strong></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/J0GZNLFasD4icT0p7Hm1mW2gZlnxzegW422qo26ibib5BTpG3YPqrcFlemHOia0evYH2WD8YtGmJU72ibXEq0tEDIZw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/J0GZNLFasD4icT0p7Hm1mW2gZlnxzegW47QL3KkrgQqmlHFx4h5DUoIjjHBfib9Ux09o99DLt3U8mAJc2YzBqvew/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>文案：</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>陈楠 陈美娟</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>排版：</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>陈楠</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>审核：</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>赵曙东 魏运 王金</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/Z6uh0fb0vBXJCuDpbWtW9XT7ngJjoMQf6Jy5zmwAwlUuXgkfwWpVxEcib3LW4nmeS1Tb89y1gxPOsnyhb2dAWKZTU4CIK79e1jGdUN41Fmyk/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"37dd922ea21e2cdd57f6bf2785efa330dd1ef563775f361b667c6492d2eace8e","textLength":1450,"sourceSha256":"39a1434c58253eda9